        "text": "Patrick Kolb (born 26 September 1994) is a German and British racing driver and team owner who last competed in the GT World Challenge Europe Endurance Cup for Lionspeed GP. He founded the team in 2019, and won the Nürburgring 24 Hours in SP9 Pro-Am in 2020 and 2024.",
